## Flow Logic

1. User provides feature description
2. Execute modes sequentially: WRITE_USER_STORIES → GENERATE_CODE → GENERATE_TESTS → REVIEW → CLEAN_AND_REFACTOR → REPORT
3. Each multi-turn mode tracks turns and test status
